next time..."}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!"}}, {"contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}], "type": "learning_skills"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment."}], "type": "post_instructions"}]}], "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}], "stimuli": [{"contents": [{}], "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"contents": [{"type": "video", "value": {"images": [{"time": "0", "text": "", "id": 0, "image": ""}, {"time": "100", "text": "You're looking for some ways to change your lifestyle. You have some personal goals. If you become a volunteer, you may achieve many of them. Here's a list of reasons that may encourage you to spend some time helping others in a volunteer position.<br/>\nYou say to yourself: \u201cI must stay healthy\u201d. Volunteering is good for you. Volunteering provides physical and mental rewards. How? Primarily, by reducing stress. Experts report that if you focus on something or someone other than yourself, your outlook will change, which may alter some stress-producing mechanisms in the body. Volunteering also makes you healthier in other ways. Feelings like optimism, joy and control over one's fate are known to strengthen the immune system.", "id": 1, "image": ""}, {"time": "46500", "text": "You say to yourself: \u201cI have to do more to support my community\u201d. Volunteering strengthens your community while saving public dollars. Volunteering provides valuable community services supporting youth, improving healthcare and making the neighborhood beautiful. Because of volunteering hours, more money can be spent on local improvements. If you donate your time, local hospitals and community centers will be able to invest their precious resources in other areas.<br/>\nYou say to yourself: \u201cI must get more practical work experience\u201d. Volunteers gain professional experience. You can test out a career, pad your r\u00e9sum\u00e9 and get good references. For example, if you volunteer for a non-profit organization, you might learn about the operations of government.", "id": 2, "image": ""}, {"time": "96000", "text": "You say to yourself: \u201cI must be more social\u201d. As a volunteer, you help bring people together from diverse backgrounds to work toward a common goal, building camaraderie and fostering teamwork. <br/>\nYou say to yourself: \u201cI must work on my personal development\u201d. Volunteering promotes personal growth and self-esteem. It encourages engagement in the community and promotes civic responsibility. If you understand community needs, you may develop empathy and feelings of self-efficacy. <br/>\nMost importantly, volunteering is about the people you help.  You make a huge difference in the lives of many people.", "id": 3, "image": ""}], "video_src": "engenn11le13ob05re2vid01"}}], "template_override": 1, "type": "video", "id": 2, "_data": [], "title": ""}], "id": 0}]}